A node taken out of a ring without relinking its successor's predecessor
leaves that link on an empty slot.

Caught-by: fuzz fuzz-pmp8 fuzz-grain32 fuzz-work test qemu-replay
Report: empty slot keeps links
Report: predecessor link to a slot that is not a live, filled one
Report: predecessor's next is not the slot
Report: sibling ring does not close

